| `check_T` practice mechanisms | Refuses a practice whose `enforced_by` names a mechanism that does not exist. A section outside the fully matched `[0-9]{1,4}` grammar gives one finding and exits CONFIG; a missing mechanism stays FAILURE. Non-string ids and references give grammar findings. | `make check` | [a practice's `enforced_by`](settings.md#configpracticesjson) | Silent without a practices registry. It proves the mechanism exists, not that it enforces the practice. | [coding-practices.md](../guides/coding-practices.md) | always |
